<title>USA: Laminating Tech names Carlock CFO.</title>
<headline>Laminating Tech names Carlock CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laminating Technologies Inc said Monday it named Richard Carlock chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Carlock will accomplish his duties as chief financial officer on a part-time basis.</p>
<p>Carlock has served as chief financial officer and treasurer for 4Health Inc from 1995-1996.</p>
